<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN PRIVATISATION AGENCY TO AUCTION EESTI FOSFORIIT.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN PRIVATISATION AGENCY TO AUCTION EESTI FOSFORIIT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian Privatisation Agency is to sell 80 percent of phosphate mining company Eesti Fosforiit by auction on July 4, the agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>An agency official also told Reuters that the starting price for the mining company is 16 million kroons. </p>
<p>It is located close to Tallinn at Maardu.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
